# Nothing personal is ignored by default, so your CV and applications are
# versioned with git. This is only safe in a PRIVATE repo: create your copy with
# "Use this template" on GitHub and choose Private before you add your own CV
# (see README, "Privacy").
#
# If you prefer to keep your personal files untracked (no history, no backup),
# remove the leading "# " from the two lines below. The examples/ folder stays tracked.
# my-cv/
# applications/

# Editor and system noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
~$*
